{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/RevocationFeed","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The optional session-revocation feed poller (CONTRACT.md §10.4, contract 1.44 — AXIAM"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"threats T-39 and T-143)."}],"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/ScA","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/12_Concurrency8AnyActorP"],"title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/revocationfeed"]}],"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"actor","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"RevocationFeed","kind":"identifier"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"What this narrows, and what it is not","anchor":"What-this-narrows-and-what-it-is-not"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"An AXIAM access token is self-contained and valid for up to fifteen minutes, and this SDK","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"verifies it locally. A logout, a role removal or an account disable therefore does not","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reach a token already in a caller’s hands until it expires — §10.2 records that, and the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"documented answer has been “route the decision through gRPC introspection instead”, which","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is correct and costs a round trip ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"per request","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A deployment may publish ","type":"text"},{"code":"GET \/oauth2\/revocations","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": the base64url-unpadded SHA-256 of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"every session id revoked within the last access-token lifetime. A guard that polls it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"rejects a revoked session within ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"one poll interval"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" instead of one token lifetime, for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"one cacheable fetch per interval.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It is NOT a control, and every rule below follows from that:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Default off.","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" Nothing polls unless a caller constructs one and attaches it.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Never on the request path.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/RevocationFeed\/isRevoked(_:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" answers from the cached set and, at"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"most, refreshes a set the "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"next"}]},{"type":"text","text":" caller sees."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Never fail closed.","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" An unreachable feed, a non-"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"200"},{"type":"text","text":", a body that does not parse, an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"alg"},{"type":"text","text":" this build does not know — every one of them behaves exactly as no feed at all."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Not as an empty list: an empty list asserts that nothing has been revoked, which is a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"guard that silently honours no revocations while appearing to honour them."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"It only ever rejects.","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" Every §10.1 rule runs first and still decides. The feed can"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"turn an accept into a reject and never the reverse."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A token with no ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sid"},{"text":" is never matched.","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" There is no session behind a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"client-credentials token, an RPT or a token exchange, and hashing ","type":"text"},{"code":"jti","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" instead would","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"match nothing while looking like it worked.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"actor"},{"type":"text","text":", so one instance can be shared across guards and they poll once between them"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rather than once each. Callers do not build one directly: set"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamConfig\/revocationFeedEnabled"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient"},{"type":"text","text":" wires it to the same transport"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"every other call already uses."}]}]}],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK14RevocationFeedC","modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"roleHeading":"Class","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"RevocationFeed","kind":